        {
          "id": 2384534515,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Can I know what ieee80211 version the changes are mapping to?\nBased on 802.11REVme_D7.0, B10 and B11 are Reserved. B12 is BIP Compact Encapsulation.\nSPP A-MSDU Capable is in Extended RSN Capabilities B14.\nThe change are based on old version.",
          "author": {
            "id": 14135780,
            "username": "WFA-achuang",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Albert Chuang",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/de830255c023f1c7bb7c5fa7c534c852bd15b0043d6a2ff18750f6c1c7bce62a?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/WFA-achuang"
          },
          "created_at": "2025-03-07T07:25:44.827Z",
