        {
          "id": 2403022692,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I'm using 802.11-2020, section 9.4.2.24.4 and figure 9-289. I don't have access to 802.11REVme_D7.0, I'm waiting for the official release 802.11-2024 to get it.",
